<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on UK gambling basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on UK gambling basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 25 million American-style warrants on a UK gambling deregulation basket, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>The basket includes shares of Stanley Leisure, Ladbrokes, Stakis and London Clubs International.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    70.0 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  0.70 STG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	11.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
